        "custom_liquid_header_efx": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{% comment %}\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════\n  📝 EDITAR AQUI — HEADER CINEMATOGRAFICO HOLLYWOOD (entrada dramatica)\n  Si NO te gusta, BORRA desde este comentario hasta el cierre de etiqueta\n  style de mas abajo (lo marca \"FIN HEADER CINEMATOGRAFICO\").\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════\n{% endcomment %}\n{% assign HDR_ACCENT = \"var(--brand-primary)\" %}\n{% assign HDR_ACCENT_LIGHT = \"var(--brand-bright)\" %}\n{% assign HDR_GLOW_INTENSITY = \"30px\" %}\n\n{% comment %} ═══ ↓ NO TOCAR DE AQUI HACIA ABAJO ↓ ═══ {% endcomment %}\n<style>\n/* ── HEADER WRAPPER: posicionamiento para pseudo-elementos ── */\n.shopify-section-group-header-group,\nheader.shopify-section-header,\n.shopify-section-header{position:relative !important;overflow:visible !important;z-index:50;}\n\n/* ── PARTÍCULAS ROJAS FLOTANTES en el header ── */\n.shopify-section-group-header-group::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:1;background:radial-gradient(2px 2px at 8% 30%,rgba(var(--brand-primary-rgb),.85),transparent),radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 18% 65%,rgba(255,90,80,.7),transparent),radial-gradient(2px 2px at 32% 40%,rgba(var(--brand-primary-rgb),.75),transparent),radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 45% 75%,rgba(255,90,80,.6),transparent),radial-gradient(2px 2px at 58% 35%,rgba(var(--brand-primary-rgb),.8),transparent),radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 72% 60%,rgba(var(--brand-primary-rgb),.7),transparent),radial-gradient(2px 2px at 86% 40%,rgba(255,90,80,.75),transparent),radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 95% 70%,rgba(var(--brand-primary-rgb),.6),transparent);animation:gfsHdrParticles 4s ease-in-out infinite;}\n\n/* ── LÍNEA ROJA BRILLANTE que crece desde el centro ── */\n.shopify-section-group-header-group::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:0;width:0;height:3px;transform:translateX(-50%);background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 0%,{{ HDR_ACCENT }} 25%,{{ HDR_ACCENT_LIGHT }} 50%,{{ HDR_ACCENT }} 75%,transparent 100%);animation:gfsHdrLineGrow 2s .4s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) forwards;box-shadow:0 0 25px {{ HDR_ACCENT }},0 0 50px rgba(var(--brand-primary-rgb),.5);z-index:99;}\n\n/* ── LOGO: entrada zoom + blur + glow rojo ── */\n.header__heading,.header__heading-link,.header__logo{position:relative !important;z-index:10 !important;animation:gfsHdrLogoEntrance 1.4s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) backwards !important;}\n.header__heading img,.header__heading-link img,.header__logo img,.header__heading-logo{transition:transform .4s ease !important;}\n.header__heading:hover img,.header__heading-link:hover img{transform:scale(1.04);}\n\n/* ── MENÚ + ICONOS: fade-in escalonado ── */\n.header__menu,nav.header__inline-menu,.header__icons{animation:gfsHdrFadeIn 1s 1s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) backwards !important;position:relative;z-index:5;}\n.header__icon:nth-child(1){animation:gfsHdrFadeIn 1s 1.0s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) backwards !important;}\n.header__icon:nth-child(2){animation:gfsHdrFadeIn 1s 1.15s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) backwards !important;}\n.header__icon:nth-child(3){animation:gfsHdrFadeIn 1s 1.3s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) backwards !important;}\n.header__menu-item{animation:gfsHdrFadeIn 1s 1.05s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) backwards !important;}\n.header__menu-item:nth-child(2){animation-delay:1.15s !important;}\n.header__menu-item:nth-child(3){animation-delay:1.25s !important;}\n\n/* ── KEYFRAMES ── */\n@keyframes gfsHdrLogoEntrance{\n  0%{opacity:0;transform:scale(.7) translateY(-20px);filter:blur(8px);}\n  60%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1.05);filter:blur(0);}\n  100%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1);filter:none;}\n}\n@keyframes gfsHdrLineGrow{\n  0%{width:0;opacity:0;}\n  35%{width:30%;opacity:1;}\n  100%{width:88%;opacity:1;}\n}\n@keyframes gfsHdrFadeIn{\n  0%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-12px);filter:blur(6px);}\n  100%{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);filter:blur(0);}\n}\n@keyframes gfsHdrParticles{\n  0%,100%{opacity:.5;transform:translateY(0);}\n  50%{opacity:.9;transform:translateY(-4px);}\n}\n\n/* ── Mobile: ajustes para que se vea bien también ── */\n@media(max-width:749px){\n  .shopify-section-group-header-group::after{animation-duration:1.6s;height:2px;}\n  @keyframes gfsHdrLogoEntrance{\n    0%{opacity:0;transform:scale(.6) translateY(-20px);filter:blur(10px);}\n    40%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1.1);filter:blur(0) drop-shadow(0 0 40px rgba(var(--brand-primary-rgb),1));}\n    100%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1);filter:drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(var(--brand-primary-rgb),.5));}\n  }\n}\n</style>\n{% comment %} ═══ ↑ FIN HEADER CINEMATOGRÁFICO ↑ ═══ {% endcomment %}\n\n"
