        "custom_liquid": "{% comment %}\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════\n  📝 EDITAR AQUI — MENSAJES DE AUTORIDAD (separados por |)\n  ⚠️ EJEMPLO — reemplazar por las cifras reales de la tienda cuando existan.\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════\n{% endcomment %}\n{% assign ITEMS = \"Importadores directos|+12.000 clientes satisfechos|+30.000 productos entregados|Calidad premium garantizada\" %}\n{% assign SEP_EMOJI = \"★\" %}\n{% assign SPEED = \"26s\" %}\n\n{% comment %} ═══ ↓ NO TOCAR DE AQUI HACIA ABAJO ↓ ═══ {% endcomment %}\n<style>\n.gfs-auth{margin:22px 0;padding:13px 0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--brand-primary),var(--brand-dark));overflow:hidden;position:relative;}\n.gfs-auth__track{display:flex;width:max-content;animation:gfsAuthScroll var(--sp,26s) linear infinite;}\n.gfs-auth:hover .gfs-auth__track{animation-play-state:paused;}\n.gfs-auth__item{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:0 26px;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;letter-spacing:.4px;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap;}\n.gfs-auth__sep{color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);font-size:12px;}\n@keyframes gfsAuthScroll{0%{transform:translateX(0);}100%{transform:translateX(-50%);}}\n@media(min-width:750px){.gfs-auth__item{font-size:16px;padding:0 34px;}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"gfs-auth\" style=\"--sp:{{ SPEED }};\">\n  <div class=\"gfs-auth__track\">\n    {% assign LIST = ITEMS | split: '|' %}\n    {% for pass in (1..2) %}\n      {% for it in LIST %}<span class=\"gfs-auth__item\">{{ it }}<span class=\"gfs-auth__sep\">{{ SEP_EMOJI }}</span></span>{% endfor %}\n    {% endfor %}\n  </div>\n</div>\n",
